## About Zigtoberfest

Zigtoberfest is an independent conference dedicated not only to [Zig](https://ziglang.org/) but also to programming in general. Its primary goal is to provide a platform for hobbyists and professionals to connect and share knowledge as well as their passion for programming.

## Sponsoring Information

Is your organization interested in supporting Zigtoberfest? Email us at <a href="mailto:info@zigtoberfest.de">info@zigtoberfest.de</a> for more information.

